# type(scope): summary        <- 72 chars max, imperative, no trailing period
#
# Why this change is needed, and what it does. Wrap at 72 characters.
# Explain the reasoning, not the diff - the diff is already in the commit.
#
# Refs: AXE-123
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# type   feat     a new capability
#        fix      a bug fix
#        docs     documentation only
#        test     tests only
#        refactor behaviour-preserving code change
#        perf     performance work
#        chore    tooling, deps, housekeeping
#        ci       CI/CD pipelines and workflows
#        build    build system or packaging
#        infra    Terraform, Bicep and infrastructure
#        style    formatting only, no code change
#        revert   reverts a previous commit
#
# scope  optional, lowercase, e.g. (billing) (auth) (ios) (postgres)
#        omit it rather than inventing a vague one
#
# Breaking change: put ! before the colon  ->  feat(api)!: drop v1 endpoints
#
# Examples
#   fix(billing): capture only added entities on auto-start
#   docs: correct subscription API routes to match controllers
#   ci: run checks on uat as well as main
#   feat(subscription)!: require currency on plan creation
#
# Enforced on pull request titles by the lint-pr-metadata CI job.
# No AI attribution: no Co-Authored-By trailers naming an assistant, no
# "Generated with" footers, no AI product names. The commit-msg hook rejects them.
